    "selected_contract": {
      "name": "REAL_POSITIVE_ROOT_UNIQUENESS_BEFORE_CANONICAL_MACRO_TRANSPORT",
      "status": "DEPENDENCY_READY_SCOUT_CONDITIONAL_ON61_ADMISSION_AND_NEW_STATEMENT_TOPOLOGY_SEAL",
      "generic_contract": "For arbitrary measurable Ω and measure μ, bounded positive REAL operators A,B on Lp ℝ 2 μ with A*A=B*B satisfy A=B. No REAL-CFC/finiteness/Nontrivial premise.",
      "actual_contract": "Under unchanged original PBPS C2/two-Hessian/positive-capped-step/finiteHilbertBorel binders, produce same actual laws/S/T as61 and Γ positive with Γ²=I-T² and all-u scalar energy, plus ∀Γ′, Γ′ positive→Γ′²=I-T²→Γ′=Γ. Uniqueness quantifies ALL positive square roots, not only roots already supplied an energy certificate.",
      "genuine_consumer": "Original-input anonymous Test obtains actual SAME T/Γ; any positive alternative square root of that SAME actual defect equals Γ, hence has the actual scalar energy/contractivity. No caller T/law/energy/normalizer certificate.",
      "why_smallest": "D1/B10 defines canonical unique nonnegative root.61 closes existence/descent but does not export real uniqueness. Square-injectivity is one bounded generic mathematical delta with direct actual-root consumer; it avoids bundling macro completeness/domain/onto-M/adjointrange alignment. Once admitted it supports canonical macro uniqueness by conjugating any competing root back through the same actual e.",
      "mathlib_ready": "Reuse complex positive-lift formula and CFC uniqueness; no new generic wrappers for existing isometry/adjoint/conjugation APIs.",
      "source_completion": "Closes the scoped REAL uniqueness background/canonical scalar-root gap; still not whole B10/B11 or joint GammaP."
    },
    "route_max7": [
      "Take arbitrary positive real A/B with A²=B² and invoke public60 complex lift on each for the SAME μ; canonical ι,R,Q are identical definitions.",
      "For each complex g, public hformula plus map_add/map_smul/intertwining expands Ac(Ac g)=ι(A(A(Rg)))+I•ι(A(A(Qg))) and similarly Bc²g; the real square equality implies lifted-square equality. No private decomposition proof copy is needed.",
      "Construct the pinned complex and restricted-real selfadjoint non-unital CFC instances internally as61; both complex lifts are positive. No all-real CFC premise.",
      "Apply complex CFC.sqrt_unique twice for the common square (or mul_self_eq_mul_self_iff) to obtain Ac=Bc.",
      "Evaluate lift equality on ιu and use public60 intertwining. Public norm preservation of canonical ι gives injectivity (a local isometry/norm argument), hence A=B.",
      "Invoke compiled61 actual original-input producer to obtain the SAME normalized S/T/Γ and defect; apply the generic uniqueness interface to every competing positive Γ′ with Γ′² equal to that SAME defect. Preserve all source contracts and energy.",
      "A genuine original-input Test compares an arbitrary alternative positive root to the produced root and transfers its scalar energy/contractivity. Preserve rank0/endpoint/infinite-L2; keep macro transport/B*B/centered inverse/polar separate."
    ],
